21
00:02:09,400 --> 00:02:11,030
Had you left on your own,

22
00:02:11,480 --> 00:02:12,910
I wouldn't have cared.

23
00:02:13,960 --> 00:02:16,670
But since you insist on taking these slaves with you,

24
00:02:17,800 --> 00:02:19,630
that makes you my enemy.

25
00:02:20,880 --> 00:02:21,800
Have you

26
00:02:22,160 --> 00:02:23,550
thought this through ?

27
00:02:27,840 --> 00:02:29,430
What are you going to do about it ?

28
00:02:32,640 --> 00:02:33,310
Back off !

29
00:02:34,120 --> 00:02:34,590
Quick,

30
00:02:34,720 --> 00:02:35,870
everyone hide !

31
00:02:41,120 --> 00:02:41,790
Ta Shan !

32
00:02:48,440 --> 00:02:49,390
These avatars

33
00:02:49,880 --> 00:02:51,390
are much stronger than the previous one.

34
00:02:56,880 --> 00:02:58,470
A cowardly rat that only shows its tail !

35
00:03:00,520 --> 00:03:02,190
You don't even show your main body,

36
00:03:02,840 --> 00:03:04,720
and you call yourself a Celestial ?
